cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this calculator or its methodology, please cite it as below."
title: "CO₂ Impact Calculator for AI Inference"
version: "2.3"
date-released: "2026-06-09"
license: "MIT"
url: "https://github.com/berget-ai/co2-calculator"
repository-code: "https://github.com/berget-ai/co2-calculator"
abstract: >
  A vendor-neutral, scientifically-grounded CO₂ emissions calculator for AI inference
  workloads. Covers GPU operational energy, server infrastructure, datacenter cooling
  (PUE), hardware embodied carbon, and training amortisation. Based on the Green
  Software Foundation's SCI-AI specification. Methodology reviewed by Stockholm
  Environment Institute (SEI).
authors:
